<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<LanguageData>
  <!-- EN: ate without table -->
  <AteWithoutTable.stages.ate_without_table.label>comeu sem mesa</AteWithoutTable.stages.ate_without_table.label>
  <!-- EN: I had to eat a meal off the ground. Can't we get a table around here? -->
  <AteWithoutTable.stages.ate_without_table.description>Tive de comer uma refeição no chão. Não podemos arranjar uma mesa por aqui?</AteWithoutTable.stages.ate_without_table.description>
  <!-- EN: bonded animal {0} banished -->
  <BondedAnimalBanished.stages.bonded_animal_banished.label>animal ligado {0} banido</BondedAnimalBanished.stages.bonded_animal_banished.label>
  <!-- EN: My bonded animal was banished! -->
  <BondedAnimalBanished.stages.bonded_animal_banished.description>O meu animal foi banido!</BondedAnimalBanished.stages.bonded_animal_banished.description>
  <!-- EN: I butchered humanlike -->
  <ButcheredHumanlikeCorpse.stages.I_butchered_humanlike.label>Eu acariciei humanos</ButcheredHumanlikeCorpse.stages.I_butchered_humanlike.label>
  <!-- EN: I butchered someone up like an animal. -->
  <ButcheredHumanlikeCorpse.stages.I_butchered_humanlike.description>Eu acariciei alguém como um animal.</ButcheredHumanlikeCorpse.stages.I_butchered_humanlike.description>
  <!-- EN: butchered humanlike corpse -->
  <ButcheredHumanlikeCorpseOpinion.stages.butchered_humanlike_corpse.label>açougue cadáver humano</ButcheredHumanlikeCorpseOpinion.stages.butchered_humanlike_corpse.label>
  <!-- EN: catharsis -->
  <Catharsis.stages.catharsis.label>catharse</Catharsis.stages.catharsis.label>
  <!-- EN: It felt good to finally unbottle my feelings. -->
  <Catharsis.stages.catharsis.description>Senti-me bom finalmente desabotar os meus sentimentos.</Catharsis.stages.catharsis.description>
  <!-- EN: colonist banished -->
  <ColonistBanished.stages.colonist_banished.label>colono banido</ColonistBanished.stages.colonist_banished.label>
  <!-- EN: We just banished someone. I hope they make it, but I'm worried. -->
  <ColonistBanished.stages.colonist_banished.description>Acabamos de banir alguém. Espero que consigam, mas estou preocupado.</ColonistBanished.stages.colonist_banished.description>
  <!-- EN: colonist banished to death -->
  <ColonistBanishedToDie.stages.colonist_banished_to_death.label>colono banido até a morte</ColonistBanishedToDie.stages.colonist_banished_to_death.label>
  <!-- EN: We banished someone in such a way that there's almost no way they'll survive. -->
  <ColonistBanishedToDie.stages.colonist_banished_to_death.description>Nós banimos alguém de tal forma que não há quase nenhuma maneira de sobreviver.</ColonistBanishedToDie.stages.colonist_banished_to_death.description>
  <!-- EN: Colonist prisoner escaped -->
  <ColonyPrisonerEscaped.stages.Colonist_prisoner_escaped.label>Prisioneiro cólonista fugiu</ColonyPrisonerEscaped.stages.Colonist_prisoner_escaped.label>
  <!-- EN: Can't we keep control of our own people? I feel like anything could happen to me here. -->
  <ColonyPrisonerEscaped.stages.Colonist_prisoner_escaped.description>Não podemos manter o controlo do nosso pessoal? Sinto que algo me pode acontecer aqui.</ColonyPrisonerEscaped.stages.Colonist_prisoner_escaped.description>
  <!-- EN: defeated hostile leader {0} -->
  <DefeatedHostileFactionLeader.stages.defeated_hostile_leader.label>derrotado líder hostil não</DefeatedHostileFactionLeader.stages.defeated_hostile_leader.label>
  <!-- EN: They were leading efforts to destroy us, and I took them down! -->
  <DefeatedHostileFactionLeader.stages.defeated_hostile_leader.description>Eles estavam a conduzir esforços para nos destruir, e eu derrubei-os!</DefeatedHostileFactionLeader.stages.defeated_hostile_leader.description>
  <!-- EN: defeated hostile leader -->
  <DefeatedHostileFactionLeaderOpinion.stages.defeated_hostile_leader.label>derrotado líder hostil</DefeatedHostileFactionLeaderOpinion.stages.defeated_hostile_leader.label>
  <!-- EN: defeated insect hive -->
  <DefeatedInsectHive.stages.defeated_insect_hive.label>hive de insetos derrotados</DefeatedInsectHive.stages.defeated_insect_hive.label>
  <!-- EN: The only good bug is a dead bug! -->
  <DefeatedInsectHive.stages.defeated_insect_hive.description>O único bom bug é um bug morto!</DefeatedInsectHive.stages.defeated_insect_hive.description>
  <!-- EN: defeated mech cluster -->
  <DefeatedMechCluster.stages.defeated_mech_cluster.label>cluster de mech derrotado</DefeatedMechCluster.stages.defeated_mech_cluster.label>
  <!-- EN: Blood beats metal, you damn machines! -->
  <DefeatedMechCluster.stages.defeated_mech_cluster.description>Sangue bate metal, malditas máquinas!</DefeatedMechCluster.stages.defeated_mech_cluster.description>
  <!-- EN: denied joining -->
  <DeniedJoining.stages.denied_joining.label>negada união</DeniedJoining.stages.denied_joining.label>
  <!-- EN: We just denied someone's request to join us. I hope they make it. -->
  <DeniedJoining.stages.denied_joining.description>Negamos o pedido de alguém para se juntar a nós. Espero que consigam.</DeniedJoining.stages.denied_joining.description>
  <!-- EN: failed to rescue {0} -->
  <FailedToRescueRelative.stages.failed_to_rescue.label>não conseguiu resgatar {0}</FailedToRescueRelative.stages.failed_to_rescue.label>
  <!-- EN: We had a chance to rescue my relative, and failed. I could have helped! -->
  <FailedToRescueRelative.stages.failed_to_rescue.description>Tivemos a oportunidade de resgatar o meu parente e falhou. Podia ter ajudado!</FailedToRescueRelative.stages.failed_to_rescue.description>
  <!-- EN: freed from slavery -->
  <FreedFromSlavery.stages.freed_from_slavery.label>livre da escravidão</FreedFromSlavery.stages.freed_from_slavery.label>
  <!-- EN: I have been freed from slavery. I'm so thankful! -->
  <FreedFromSlavery.stages.freed_from_slavery.description>Fui libertado da escravidão. Estou tão grato!</FreedFromSlavery.stages.freed_from_slavery.description>
  <!-- EN: bloodlust organ harvested -->
  <HarvestedOrgan_Bloodlust.stages.bloodlust_organ_harvested.label>órgão hebraico colhido</HarvestedOrgan_Bloodlust.stages.bloodlust_organ_harvested.label>
  <!-- EN: Extracting the flesh from their bodies is so bloody and satisfying. -->
  <HarvestedOrgan_Bloodlust.stages.bloodlust_organ_harvested.description>Extrair a carne de seus corpos é tão sangrenta e satisfatória.</HarvestedOrgan_Bloodlust.stages.bloodlust_organ_harvested.description>
  <!-- EN: killed someone -->
  <KilledHumanlikeBloodlust.stages.killed_someone.label>matou alguém</KilledHumanlikeBloodlust.stages.killed_someone.label>
  <!-- EN: I killed someone! What a rush! -->
  <KilledHumanlikeBloodlust.stages.killed_someone.description>Matei alguém! Que pressa!</KilledHumanlikeBloodlust.stages.killed_someone.description>
  <!-- EN: buried in sarcophagus -->
  <KnowBuriedInSarcophagus.stages.buried_in_sarcophagus.label>enterrado no sarcófago</KnowBuriedInSarcophagus.stages.buried_in_sarcophagus.label>
  <!-- EN: This colony buried someone in an ornamented sarcophagus. May their soul rest in peace. -->
  <KnowBuriedInSarcophagus.stages.buried_in_sarcophagus.description>Esta colónia enterrou alguém num sarcófago ornamentado. Que a sua alma descanse em paz.</KnowBuriedInSarcophagus.stages.buried_in_sarcophagus.description>
  <!-- EN: we butchered humanlike -->
  <KnowButcheredHumanlikeCorpse.stages.we_butchered_humanlike.label>nós acariciamos humano como</KnowButcheredHumanlikeCorpse.stages.we_butchered_humanlike.label>
  <!-- EN: We butchered someone up like an animal. -->
  <KnowButcheredHumanlikeCorpse.stages.we_butchered_humanlike.description>Acabámos alguém como um animal.</KnowButcheredHumanlikeCorpse.stages.we_butchered_humanlike.description>
  <!-- EN: colonist's organ harvested -->
  <KnowColonistOrganHarvested.stages.colonists_organ_harvested.label>órgão colhido</KnowColonistOrganHarvested.stages.colonists_organ_harvested.label>
  <!-- EN: Someone took body parts from a colonist. It's horrible, breaking someone down for parts when they have no choice. -->
  <KnowColonistOrganHarvested.stages.colonists_organ_harvested.description>Alguém tirou partes do corpo de um colonizador. É horrível, destruir alguém por partes quando não têm escolha.</KnowColonistOrganHarvested.stages.colonists_organ_harvested.description>
  <!-- EN: someone's organ harvested -->
  <KnowGuestOrganHarvested.stages.someones_organ_harvested.label>órgão de alguém colhido</KnowGuestOrganHarvested.stages.someones_organ_harvested.label>
  <!-- EN: The colony took body parts from a guest or prisoner. It's horrible, breaking someone down for parts when they have no choice. -->
  <KnowGuestOrganHarvested.stages.someones_organ_harvested.description>A colônia tomou partes do corpo de um convidado ou prisioneiro. É horrível, destruir alguém por partes quando não têm escolha.</KnowGuestOrganHarvested.stages.someones_organ_harvested.description>
  <!-- EN: prisoner sold -->
  <KnowPrisonerSold.stages.prisoner_sold.label>prisioneiro vendido</KnowPrisonerSold.stages.prisoner_sold.label>
  <!-- EN: This colony sold a prisoner into slavery. That's a worrying thought. -->
  <KnowPrisonerSold.stages.prisoner_sold.description>Esta colónia vendeu um prisioneiro à escravidão. É um pensamento preocupante.</KnowPrisonerSold.stages.prisoner_sold.description>
  <!-- EN: my organ harvested -->
  <MyOrganHarvested.stages.my_organ_harvested.label>meu órgão colhido</MyOrganHarvested.stages.my_organ_harvested.label>
  <!-- EN: The colony harvested body parts from me! They're breaking me down like an old engine! -->
  <MyOrganHarvested.stages.my_organ_harvested.description>A colónia colheu partes do corpo de mim! Eles estão a derrubar-me como um velho motor!</MyOrganHarvested.stages.my_organ_harvested.description>
  <!-- EN: initial hope -->
  <NewColonyHope.stages.initial_hope.label>esperança inicial</NewColonyHope.stages.initial_hope.label>
  <!-- EN: I'm getting used to this, but it's still an exciting new situation. I hope this works out... -->
  <NewColonyHope.stages.initial_hope.description>Estou a habituar-me a isto, mas ainda é uma nova situação excitante. Espero que isto resulte...</NewColonyHope.stages.initial_hope.description>
  <!-- EN: initial optimism -->
  <NewColonyOptimism.stages.initial_optimism.label>otimismo inicial</NewColonyOptimism.stages.initial_optimism.label>
  <!-- EN: It's a tough situation, but I'm excited to be founding a new settlement. -->
  <NewColonyOptimism.stages.initial_optimism.description>É uma situação difícil, mas estou animado para fundar um novo acordo.</NewColonyOptimism.stages.initial_optimism.description>
  <!-- EN: nuzzled -->
  <Nuzzled.stages.nuzzled.label>nuzzled</Nuzzled.stages.nuzzled.label>
  <!-- EN: A cute animal nuzzled me. -->
  <Nuzzled.stages.nuzzled.description>Um animal fofo aborreceu-me.</Nuzzled.stages.nuzzled.description>
  <!-- EN: observed corpse -->
  <ObservedLayingCorpse.stages.observed_corpse.label>cadáver observado</ObservedLayingCorpse.stages.observed_corpse.label>
  <!-- EN: I saw a dead body laying on the ground. It was disturbing. -->
  <ObservedLayingCorpse.stages.observed_corpse.description>Vi um cadáver no chão. Foi perturbador.</ObservedLayingCorpse.stages.observed_corpse.description>
  <!-- EN: observed rotting corpse -->
  <ObservedLayingRottingCorpse.stages.observed_rotting_corpse.label>observado corpo podre</ObservedLayingRottingCorpse.stages.observed_rotting_corpse.label>
  <!-- EN: I saw a rotting corpse laying on the ground. It was disgusting. -->
  <ObservedLayingRottingCorpse.stages.observed_rotting_corpse.description>Vi um cadáver podre no chão. Foi nojento.</ObservedLayingRottingCorpse.stages.observed_rotting_corpse.description>
  <!-- EN: on duty -->
  <OnDuty.stages.on_duty.label>ao serviço</OnDuty.stages.on_duty.label>
  <!-- EN: I have a job to do. -->
  <OnDuty.stages.on_duty.description>Tenho um trabalho a fazer.</OnDuty.stages.on_duty.description>
  <!-- EN: prisoner banished to death -->
  <PrisonerBanishedToDie.stages.prisoner_banished_to_death.label>prisioneiro banido à morte</PrisonerBanishedToDie.stages.prisoner_banished_to_death.label>
  <!-- EN: We banished a prisoner in such a way that there's almost no way they'll survive. -->
  <PrisonerBanishedToDie.stages.prisoner_banished_to_death.description>Nós banimos um prisioneiro de tal forma que não há quase nenhuma maneira de sobreviver.</PrisonerBanishedToDie.stages.prisoner_banished_to_death.description>
  <!-- EN: used flame weapon -->
  <PyroUsed.stages.used_flame_weapon.label>arma de fogo usada</PyroUsed.stages.used_flame_weapon.label>
  <!-- EN: The searing heat will make my foes beautiful! -->
  <PyroUsed.stages.used_flame_weapon.description>O calor do searing fará meus inimigos bonitos!</PyroUsed.stages.used_flame_weapon.description>
  <!-- EN: prisoner released -->
  <ReleasedHealthyPrisoner.stages.prisoner_released.label>prisioneiro liberado</ReleasedHealthyPrisoner.stages.prisoner_released.label>
  <!-- EN: We released a healthy prisoner. It feels good to know we even treat prisoners well. -->
  <ReleasedHealthyPrisoner.stages.prisoner_released.description>Libertamos um prisioneiro saudável. É bom saber que até tratamos prisioneiros bem.</ReleasedHealthyPrisoner.stages.prisoner_released.description>
  <!-- EN: rescued -->
  <Rescued.stages.rescued.label>resgatado</Rescued.stages.rescued.label>
  <!-- EN: I was rescued! I almost thought I was done for back there. I'm so thankful. -->
  <Rescued.stages.rescued.description>Fui resgatado! Quase pensei que tinha acabado por lá. Estou tão grato.</Rescued.stages.rescued.description>
  <!-- EN: rescued {0} -->
  <RescuedRelative.stages.rescued.label>resgatado não</RescuedRelative.stages.rescued.label>
  <!-- EN: We rescued one of my relatives. Finally, I can breathe a sigh of relief. -->
  <RescuedRelative.stages.rescued.description>Salvamos um dos meus parentes. Finalmente, consigo respirar um suspiro de alívio.</RescuedRelative.stages.rescued.description>
  <!-- EN: disturbed sleep -->
  <SleepDisturbed.stages.disturbed_sleep.label>sono perturbado</SleepDisturbed.stages.disturbed_sleep.label>
  <!-- EN: I was disturbed during sleep by people moving around nearby. A private room would solve this. -->
  <SleepDisturbed.stages.disturbed_sleep.description>Fiquei perturbado durante o sono por pessoas que se deslocavam por perto. Um quarto privado resolveria isto.</SleepDisturbed.stages.disturbed_sleep.description>
  <!-- EN: slept in the cold -->
  <SleptInCold.stages.slept_in_the_cold.label>dormiu no frio</SleptInCold.stages.slept_in_the_cold.label>
  <!-- EN: I had to sleep in the cold. We really need some heaters. -->
  <SleptInCold.stages.slept_in_the_cold.description>Tive de dormir no frio. Precisamos mesmo de aquecedores.</SleptInCold.stages.slept_in_the_cold.description>
  <!-- EN: slept in the heat -->
  <SleptInHeat.stages.slept_in_the_heat.label>dormir no calor</SleptInHeat.stages.slept_in_the_heat.label>
  <!-- EN: I had to sleep in unbearable heat. Can't we have air conditioning? -->
  <SleptInHeat.stages.slept_in_the_heat.description>Tive de dormir em calor insuportável. Não podemos ter ar condicionado?</SleptInHeat.stages.slept_in_the_heat.description>
  <!-- EN: slept on ground -->
  <SleptOnGround.stages.slept_on_ground.label>dormir no chão</SleptOnGround.stages.slept_on_ground.label>
  <!-- EN: I had to sleep on the ground like an animal. -->
  <SleptOnGround.stages.slept_on_ground.description>Tive de dormir no chão como um animal.</SleptOnGround.stages.slept_on_ground.description>
  <!-- EN: slept outside -->
  <SleptOutside.stages.slept_outside.label>dormir fora</SleptOutside.stages.slept_outside.label>
  <!-- EN: I had to sleep outdoors without any protection from the elements. -->
  <SleptOutside.stages.slept_outside.description>Tive que dormir ao ar livre sem qualquer proteção dos elementos.</SleptOutside.stages.slept_outside.description>
  <!-- EN: soaking wet -->
  <SoakingWet.stages.soaking_wet.label>molho molhado</SoakingWet.stages.soaking_wet.label>
  <!-- EN: I'm soaking wet. -->
  <SoakingWet.stages.soaking_wet.description>Estou molhado.</SoakingWet.stages.soaking_wet.description>
  <!-- EN: eager to travel -->
  <TravelAnticipation.stages.eager_to_travel.label>ansioso para viajar</TravelAnticipation.stages.eager_to_travel.label>
  <!-- EN: I've been preparing this caravan for a while. I'm looking forward to the upcoming journey. -->
  <TravelAnticipation.stages.eager_to_travel.description>Estou a preparar esta caravana há algum tempo. Estou ansioso para a próxima viagem.</TravelAnticipation.stages.eager_to_travel.description>
  <!-- EN: excited to travel -->
  <TravelAnticipation.stages.excited_to_travel.label>animado para viajar</TravelAnticipation.stages.excited_to_travel.label>
  <!-- EN: So much thought and preparation have gone into this adventure. I can't wait to set off! -->
  <TravelAnticipation.stages.excited_to_travel.description>Tanto pensamento e preparação foram para esta aventura. Mal posso esperar para partir!</TravelAnticipation.stages.excited_to_travel.description>
  <!-- EN: was imprisoned -->
  <WasImprisoned.stages.was_imprisoned.label>foi preso</WasImprisoned.stages.was_imprisoned.label>
  <!-- EN: The colony had me in jail for a while, like a caged animal. -->
  <WasImprisoned.stages.was_imprisoned.description>A colónia pôs-me na prisão durante algum tempo, como um animal enjaulado.</WasImprisoned.stages.was_imprisoned.description>
  <!-- EN: witnessed ally's death -->
  <WitnessedDeathAlly.stages.witnessed_allys_death.label>testemunharam a morte do aliado</WitnessedDeathAlly.stages.witnessed_allys_death.label>
  <!-- EN: I saw one of my people die. They were alive one moment, and dead the next. -->
  <WitnessedDeathAlly.stages.witnessed_allys_death.description>Vi um dos meus homens morrer. Eles estavam vivos um momento, e mortos no outro.</WitnessedDeathAlly.stages.witnessed_allys_death.description>
  <!-- EN: witnessed death with bloodlust -->
  <WitnessedDeathBloodlust.stages.witnessed_death_with_bloodlust.label>testemunharam a morte com sangue</WitnessedDeathBloodlust.stages.witnessed_death_with_bloodlust.label>
  <!-- EN: I saw someone die! That was intense! -->
  <WitnessedDeathBloodlust.stages.witnessed_death_with_bloodlust.description>Vi alguém morrer! Foi intenso!</WitnessedDeathBloodlust.stages.witnessed_death_with_bloodlust.description>
  <!-- EN: witnessed family member's death -->
  <WitnessedDeathFamily.stages.witnessed_family_members_death.label>testemunhou a morte do membro da família</WitnessedDeathFamily.stages.witnessed_family_members_death.label>
  <!-- EN: I saw a member of my family die. My own flesh and blood... -->
  <WitnessedDeathFamily.stages.witnessed_family_members_death.description>Vi um membro da minha família morrer. A minha carne e o meu sangue...</WitnessedDeathFamily.stages.witnessed_family_members_death.description>
  <!-- EN: witnessed outsider's death -->
  <WitnessedDeathNonAlly.stages.witnessed_outsiders_death.label>testemunharam a morte de fora</WitnessedDeathNonAlly.stages.witnessed_outsiders_death.label>
  <!-- EN: I saw someone die. They were alive one moment, and dead the next. -->
  <WitnessedDeathNonAlly.stages.witnessed_outsiders_death.description>Vi alguém morrer. Eles estavam vivos um momento, e mortos no outro.</WitnessedDeathNonAlly.stages.witnessed_outsiders_death.description>
</LanguageData>
